# SORA 4.8.12 fee and lending-retirement validation

Candidate SHA-256: `{{CANDIDATE_SHA256}}` ({{CANDIDATE_BYTES}} bytes).
Source tree: `{{SOURCE_TREE}}`; reviewed base: `{{SOURCE_BASE}}`.
Fresh native evidence records **{{NATIVE_PASSED}} passed**, zero failed,
**{{NATIVE_IGNORED}} existing ignored**, across thirteen affected suites, including
